hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"175","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mujhe paanch [cheezen] di gayi hain jo mujh se pehle kisi ko nahin di gayin: Mere liye zameen ko masjid aur taharat ka zariya banaya gaya, aur dushman par mera rob daal kar meri madad ki gayi, aur mere liye ghanimaten halal ki gayin, aur mujhe surkh aur safed [tamam insanon] ki taraf bheja gaya, aur mujhe shafa'at di gayi.'"
"176","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Saari zameen masjid [namaz ki jagah] hai, siwae hammam aur qabrastan ke.'"
"177","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Mardon ki behtareen safen pehli hain aur badtareen aakhri; aur aurton ki behtareen safen aakhri hain aur badtareen pehli.'"
